name atomic-2020-tuples
# ATOMIC 2020: a tuple on every line, three fields parted by tabs, no header row. The set's README:
#   "The data is in the form of tab-separated tuples: head, relation, tail"
# Each row is the claim of its head, its relation and its tail, every one as written.
match train.tsv dev.tsv test.tsv

tier row by \n
names head relation tail
tier field by \t

thing row head
content head relation tail
relate row relation to tail
